    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. I'm also worried about the \"human element\"—like the supplier acting in bad faith or trying to sneak in hidden fees or unfavorable terms during the middle of the contract term. How do I draft language that accounts for those kinds of sneaky or malicious actors in the supply chain?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
