      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To address bad faith and hidden fees, mandate strict audit rights that allow you to inspect your industrial accounts and require fixed pricing schedules with little to no renegotiation periods. You should also draft a \"no third-party variation\" clause prohibiting the supplier from introducing unapproved intermediaries, partners, or fees during contract execution. Additionally, define malpractice explicitly in the dispute resolution section to allow for immediate termination if they attempt to bypass contractual obligations or alter agreed terms without your written consent.",
